      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Offline-First Resilience",
      "items": [
        "Kaders can operate seamlessly in remote posyandu locations without cellular connectivity",
        "Measurements are committed locally into SQLite with a pending flag (sync_status=0)",
        "Local validation ensures height, weight, and measurement posture conform to WHO criteria"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Transactional Ingestion & Security",
      "items": [
        "Sanctum bearer token verification confirms Kader's assigned Posyandu and village jurisdiction",
        "Laravel executes DB transaction to look up WHO LMS tables and calculate HAZ, WAZ, and WHZ",
        "Returns batch confirmation containing generated server primary keys for local state update"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Zero-Loss Replay",
      "items": [
        "Mobile client marks local SQLite records as synced (sync_status=1) upon server HTTP 200",
        "Idempotent sync endpoint safely handles network drops and retries without duplicate patient records",
